---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy | NewFavorite" description="A brief overview of NewFavorite's privacy practices.">
  <article class="wrap article">
    <p class="eyebrow">SITE INFORMATION</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Recipe saves and “I tried it” preferences are stored in your browser and are not sent to NewFavorite.</p>
      <p>We use Google Analytics to understand site visits. It may collect usage, browser, and device information. Read <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      <p>NewFavorite’s newsletter is managed and sent personally by its creator. If you subscribe, your email address is used to send newsletter updates. You can unsubscribe at any time by replying to a newsletter email or contacting <a href="mailto:newfavoriteco@gmail.com">newfavoriteco@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:newfavoriteco@gmail.com">newfavoriteco@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
